{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016C6BfTPJLREdMjem5JmzjJ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp_001b_qwq_32b（准备中）\\\\n- exp_001a_r1_32b（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_015_fpr_analysis** (success): Text temporal probe's high lead time (+11.5) is inflated by false positives (trigger-happy). If text FPR >> HS FPR, the early detection is illusory and hidden-state monitoring remains necessary. If FPR comparable, paper motivation needs restructuring.\\\\n- **exp_014_bocpd_poc** (negative): BOCPD/CUSUM on probe score sequences may detect commitment earlier than raw threshold crossing by identifying distributional shift points. Potential breakthrough for Claim 3 (pre-textual detection).\\\\n- **exp_006_bootstrap_ci** (negative): Bootstrap CIs will confirm temporal methods significantly outperform static methods in crossing rate and lead time, providing statistical rigor for paper claims\\\\n  [exp_006_bootstrap_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/artifacts/exp_006_bootstrap_ci/data/bootstrap_results_pointer.txt)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 5 / 负向 6 / 失败 0 / 共 11\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nautodl-rtx6000: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1135, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BrBVhVC51yBg6Sz2Ht5fBW","session_id":"584eac82-aa50-4806-9859-0d2ba8093b1f","uuid":"5ff11a81-7e0b-4cd0-8b50-abb4b88cb034","timestamp":"2026-05-16T21:52:38.918Z"}
