{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01A9KFvFpEm3AR2To8M3qWt7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 8\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 17:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 设计：用 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B + HarmThoughts 验证 static vs temporal\\\\n    probe 的 transition localization gap\\\\n  rationale: '选择 8B 模型降低 GPU 门槛（单卡 A100 即可）；HarmThoughts 已有标注避免标注成本；static vs temporal\\\\n    对比直接验证核心假设（token-level 方法缺乏 temporal phase discrimination）。Pass gate: gap ≥ 10pp。DDL\\\\n    极紧（9天），MVP 必须 2 天内完成。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 18:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 重设计：从 transition localization 改为 commitment detection（检测 safety reasoning\\\\n    最终消失的时刻）\\\\n  rationale: 数据分析显示 first harmful label 平均在 step 2.9（任务退化），但 84% traces 在 step 10\\\\n    后仍有 safety labels 交织。Commitment point（last safety label + 1）在 step 37.9 均值，提供了有意义的\\\\n    temporal structure。Temporal probe 应能通过检测 \\\\\\\"safety label 密度下降模式\\\\\\\" 优于 static single-step\\\\n    probe。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 19:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 首次结果未过 pass gate，批准 3-4h 诊断轮（layer sweep + PCA + 降参）再决定 kill/iterate\\\\n  rationale: Static 77.8% / Temporal 75.7% 均仅比 majority baseline (74.5%) 高 1-3pp，temporal\\\\n    未优于 static。但不能确定是\\\\\\\"信号不存在\\\\\\\"还是\\\\\\\"layer 选错 / probe 过参数化\\\\\\\"。诊断成本低（3-4h），可明确区分两种情况。若诊断后最佳层仍无信号则\\\\n    kill。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 19:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 条件性通过：temporal 优势在 coverage（+30pp → oracle 上限）而非 timing，调整 framing\\\\n    为 reliability story\\\\n  rationale: Pass gate \\\\\\\"temporal ≥3 步\\\\\\\" 严格未达（delta=1.39步），但 coverage 从 46.5% → 76.7%（=\\\\n    oracle K=5 上限）是实质贡献。Oracle 确认任务可解（+31 步 lead time），当前 gap 在于 hidden state 无法直接推断未来\\\\n    label 出现与否。Coverage story = \\\\\\\"temporal makes detection reliable, not early\\\\\\\" 有强数据支撑，适合\\\\n    EMNLP empirical study + method。同时允许并行尝试 GRU 看能否恢复部分 lead time。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 19:47 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 完整通过：GRU h=256 multi-7L 达成 +4.7 步 lead time + 76.7% coverage，升级 framing\\\\n    为 coverage + timing 双贡献\\\\n  rationale: 'GRU multi-7L vs static LR: lead time +6.7 步（+4.7 vs -2.0），coverage +30pp（76.7%\\\\n    vs 46.5%）。关键发现：(1) 容量阈值效应（h=128 不够，h=256 突破），(2) multi-layer 比 single-layer 好（信号分布式），(3)\\\\n    76.7% coverage 恰等 oracle ceiling。论文 story 从 \\\\\\\"coverage only\\\\\\\" 升级为 \\\\\\\"temporal sequence\\\\n    model achieves both coverage saturation AND positive lead time\\\\\\\"。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 20:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream review 3/6 all tiers — framing/plan adjusted, adding text baseline\\\\n    + BOCPD + FPR analysis, re-dream required\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream (dream_20260516T194646) scored 3/6 across all three tiers (anomalous\\\\n    — best should score higher). Three structural issues flagged unanimously by both\\\\n    reviewers across all tiers: (1) Missing text-based baseline — cannot prove hidden-state\\\\n    monitoring adds unique value; (2) Missing change-point detection method (BOCPD)\\\\n    — both a novelty gap and a potential lead-time solution; (3) Missing FPR/precision-recall\\\\n    analysis — coverage alone is uninterpretable. Also: related work gaps (RepE, PRMs,\\\\n    Arditi 2024), title mismatch (''Contrastive'' unexplained). Actions taken: added\\\\n    exp-013 (text baseline, P0), exp-014 (BOCPD, P0), exp-015 (FPR analysis, P0);\\\\n    expanded exp-006 to include AUROC/PR/detection delay CDF; updated paper_framing.md\\\\n    with 4 new anticipated reviewer concerns + title note. Re-dream required before\\\\n    approving new P0 experiments. Note: Dream was launched on weaker framing (pre-GRU\\\\n    +4.7), so actual paper is stronger than what was reviewed.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-013\\\\n    role: new_addition\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-014\\\\n    role: new_addition\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-015\\\\n    role: new_addition\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 21:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Paper framing pivot: HS 核心价值从 coverage 优势转向 precision 优势 (pre-CP FPR 16%\\\\n    vs text 27-36%); BOCPD negative 加固 Claim 3'\\\\n  rationale: exp-015 FPR 分析揭示 HS 和 text 的 coverage 相同 (65.1%)，但 HS pre-CP FPR 仅 16%\\\\n    vs text 27-36%，precision 高 10-13pp。exp-014 BOCPD negative 确认 change-point detection\\\\n    不优于简单阈值。这两个结果共同要求 framing 调整：HS 的价值不是\\\\\\\"更高覆盖\\\\\\\"而是\\\\\\\"更精确的 pre-commitment 检测\\\\\\\"。Claim 3\\\\n    得到加固——GRU/BOCPD/CUSUM 均无法实现可靠 pre-textual detection。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-015\\\\n    role: primary evidence\\\\n    result: HS pre-CP FPR 16% vs text 27-36%, precision 58-62% vs 45-49%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-014\\\\n    role: negative result\\\\n    result: BOCPD coverage 93% but lead +3.5 < simple threshold +4.9; CUSUM all configs\\\\n      fail\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-006\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: bootstrap CIs wide, all method differences p>0.5 at n=43\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4663, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BrBVhVC51yBg6Sz2Ht5fBW","session_id":"584eac82-aa50-4806-9859-0d2ba8093b1f","uuid":"8e2c43aa-9480-4e53-9436-5c34142605a4","timestamp":"2026-05-16T21:52:43.421Z"}
