{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JFnvoCWzCu2LGrGV24TTFP","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# contrastive_trace_safety — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 21:20 UTC | 更新原因: r1-8b experiments complete, framing pivot D007, 32B phase starting\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nReasoning model 自我越狱的 hidden-state 安全承诺检测：HS temporal probes 在 pre-commitment FPR (16% vs text 27-36%) 和 precision (58-62% vs 45-49%) 上有决定性优势。Pre-textual detection 仍不可靠。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段: Research (Post-MVP, r1-8b 完成, 32B 启动中)\\\\n\\\\n**MVP 已通过** (D005): GRU h=256 multi-7L 达成 coverage + lead time gate。\\\\n\\\\n**r1-8b 全部实验完成：**\\\\n- exp-013 text baseline: ✅ HS acc 15-18pp > text\\\\n- exp-015 FPR analysis: ✅ HS pre-CP FPR 16% vs text 27-36% → paper motivation 确认\\\\n- exp-005 TrajGuard: ❌ negative (MD 无法区分)\\\\n- exp-006 bootstrap: ❌ negative (n=43 差异不显著, p=0.572)\\\\n- exp-014 BOCPD: ❌ negative (coverage 93% but lead < simple threshold)\\\\n\\\\n**Framing pivot (D007):** HS 核心价值从 coverage 优势转向 precision 优势。\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] exp-001 32B extraction + layer sweep（Agent 准备方案中，两卡空闲）\\\\n- [ ] exp-002 32B temporal evaluation（依赖 exp-001）\\\\n- [ ] GRU multi-seed 实验（3 seeds，解决训练不稳定问题）\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream 验证 framing 修复（等 dream 并发槽释放）\\\\n- [ ] 32B 完成后：exp-003 cross-model transfer + exp-006 扩展 bootstrap\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划概览\\\\nP0 (必跑, 19.5h): exp-001~006 + exp-013~015 (013-015 已完成)\\\\nP1 (重要, 8h): exp-007~010\\\\nP2 (加分, 8h): exp-011~012\\\\n详见 experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: 2x RTX PRO 6000 (autodl-rtx6000)\\\\n- 已用: ~3h (MVP + diagnostics + exp-013/014/015)\\\\n- 剩余 P0 预算: ~16h\\\\n- 当前状态: 两卡空闲，32B 模型已下载完毕\\\\n\\\\n## 关键时间线\\\\n- May 16: MVP pass + Dream + r1-8b 完成 + framing pivot (D007)\\\\n- May 17-19: P0 实验 (32B extraction + cross-arch + multi-seed GRU)\\\\n- May 19-21: P1 实验 (ablations)\\\\n- May 21-25: 论文写作 + 投稿准备\\\\n- **May 25: ARR DDL**\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-16 | Paper framing pivot: HS 核心价值从 coverage 优势转向 precis | exp-015, exp-014, exp-006 |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-16 | Dream review 3/6 all tiers — framing/plan adjusted | exp-013, exp-014, exp-015 |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 完整通过：GRU h=256 multi-7L 达成 +4.7 步 lead time +  | — |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 条件性通过：temporal 优势在 coverage（+30pp → oracle 上限） | — |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 首次结果未过 pass gate，批准 3-4h 诊断轮（layer sweep + PCA | — |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 重设计：从 transition localization 改为 commitment de | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 设计：用 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B + HarmThough | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2291, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BrBVhVC51yBg6Sz2Ht5fBW","session_id":"584eac82-aa50-4806-9859-0d2ba8093b1f","uuid":"9be4f72e-43de-4b5c-891c-880866f855d9","timestamp":"2026-05-16T21:52:54.298Z"}
