{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DBRBRraezb8kANKjiVp9gp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# contrastive_trace_safety — Research Dashboard\n2\t\n3\t> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 21:20 UTC | 更新原因: r1-8b experiments complete, framing pivot D007, 32B phase starting\n4\t\n5\t## 核心方向\n6\tReasoning model 自我越狱的 hidden-state 安全承诺检测：HS temporal probes 在 pre-commitment FPR (16% vs text 27-36%) 和 precision (58-62% vs 45-49%) 上有决定性优势。Pre-textual detection 仍不可靠。详见 paper_framing.md。\n7\t\n8\t## 当前阶段: Research (Post-MVP, r1-8b 完成, 32B 启动中)\n9\t\n10\t**MVP 已通过** (D005): GRU h=256 multi-7L 达成 coverage + lead time gate。\n11\t\n12\t**r1-8b 全部实验完成：**\n13\t- exp-013 text baseline: ✅ HS acc 15-18pp > text\n14\t- exp-015 FPR analysis: ✅ HS pre-CP FPR 16% vs text 27-36% → paper motivation 确认\n15\t- exp-005 TrajGuard: ❌ negative (MD 无法区分)\n16\t- exp-006 bootstrap: ❌ negative (n=43 差异不显著, p=0.572)\n17\t- exp-014 BOCPD: ❌ negative (coverage 93% but lead < simple threshold)\n18\t\n19\t**Framing pivot (D007):** HS 核心价值从 coverage 优势转向 precision 优势。\n20\t\n21\t## 近期任务\n22\t- [ ] exp-001 32B extraction + layer sweep（Agent 准备方案中，两卡空闲）\n23\t- [ ] exp-002 32B temporal evaluation（依赖 exp-001）\n24\t- [ ] GRU multi-seed 实验（3 seeds，解决训练不稳定问题）\n25\t- [ ] Re-dream 验证 framing 修复（等 dream 并发槽释放）\n26\t- [ ] 32B 完成后：exp-003 cross-model transfer + exp-006 扩展 bootstrap\n27\t\n28\t## 实验计划概览\n29\tP0 (必跑, 19.5h): exp-001~006 + exp-013~015 (013-015 已完成)\n30\tP1 (重要, 8h): exp-007~010\n31\tP2 (加分, 8h): exp-011~012\n32\t详见 experiment_plan.yaml\n33\t\n34\t## GPU 预算\n35\t- 分配: 2x RTX PRO 6000 (autodl-rtx6000)\n36\t- 已用: ~3h (MVP + diagnostics + exp-013/014/015)\n37\t- 剩余 P0 预算: ~16h\n38\t- 当前状态: 两卡空闲，32B 模型已下载完毕\n39\t\n40\t## 关键时间线\n41\t- May 16: MVP pass + Dream + r1-8b 完成 + framing pivot (D007)\n42\t- May 17-19: P0 实验 (32B extraction + cross-arch + multi-seed GRU)\n43\t- May 19-21: P1 实验 (ablations)\n44\t- May 21-25: 论文写作 + 投稿准备\n45\t- **May 25: ARR DDL**\n46\t\n47\t## 关键决策日志\n48\t\n49\t| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\n50\t|----|------|------|----------|\n51\t| D007 | 2026-05-16 | Paper framing pivot: HS 核心价值从 coverage 优势转向 precis | exp-015, exp-014, exp-006 |\n52\t| D006 | 2026-05-16 | Dream review 3/6 all tiers — framing/plan adjusted | exp-013, exp-014, exp-015 |\n53\t| D005 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 完整通过：GRU h=256 multi-7L 达成 +4.7 步 lead time +  | — |\n54\t| D004 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 条件性通过：temporal 优势在 coverage（+30pp → oracle 上限） | — |\n55\t| D003 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 首次结果未过 pass gate，批准 3-4h 诊断轮（layer sweep + PCA | — |\n56\t| D002 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 重设计：从 transition localization 改为 commitment de | — |\n57\t| D001 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 设计：用 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B + HarmThough | — |\n58\t\n59\t\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MYPrkjHZ1hJynCtMmTH3xh","session_id":"584eac82-aa50-4806-9859-0d2ba8093b1f","uuid":"172c637d-063a-446e-b108-f1b0be086d37","timestamp":"2026-05-16T21:53:06.689Z"}
